Open CASCADE Technology (OCCT) 8.0.1 — geometry kernel
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

OneCAD makes use of, and is based on facilities provided by, the Open
CASCADE Technology software (https://dev.opencascade.org,
https://github.com/Open-Cascade-SAS/OCCT).

Components: OCCT 8.0.1 shared libraries (libTK*.8.0.dylib), dynamically
            linked by the onecad-worker sidecar. In the macOS app bundle
            they are copied into Contents/Frameworks/ by
            scripts/bundle-dylibs.sh and loaded via @rpath.
            Built from source by scripts/build-pinned-occt.sh.

License:    GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 (LGPL-2.1),
            with the Open CASCADE exception, version 1.0.
            Verified from the installed artifact:
              <OCCT prefix>/share/doc/opencascade/LICENSE_LGPL_21.txt
              <OCCT prefix>/share/doc/opencascade/OCCT_LGPL_EXCEPTION.txt
            Full LGPL-2.1 text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-2.1.html

Source:     Unmodified upstream tag V8_0_1, commit
            b8f597c677811d1f9f4d8a97f5ae2825c0353a42
            (https://github.com/Open-Cascade-SAS/OCCT/archive/refs/tags/
            V8_0_1.tar.gz), built shared with the options recorded in
            share/onecad/occt-build.cmake by scripts/build-pinned-occt.sh.

Relinking:  Users may replace the bundled OCCT libraries with a
            compatible modified build (same major.minor ABI, 8.0.x) by
            swapping the files in Contents/Frameworks/ and re-signing.

