-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not third-party — hand-transcribed public standards
-------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following dimension data is NOT from BOLTS or any other third-party
dataset, and is listed here only so its provenance is not mistaken for the
above. It was hand-transcribed from the published dimension tables of the
named standards, which are numeric facts rather than a licensed work:

  * ISO 261 coarse thread pitch series (pitch_mm), used by every threaded
    family.

(ISO 7380-1 and ISO 7093-1 were hand-transcribed here too, and were removed
along with their generators. Neither was BOLTS data to begin with.)

